(text "J190 is the single AUX/SOLAR physical input; USB-C PD negotiation remains only on sheet 5." (at 379.73 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid a160053d-1ca1-57c0-b61c-ba6746545ea5))
(text "TPS26630 accepts 7-22V nominal; 0.1% ladder targets 5.53V/22.99V rising UV/OV and a 3A limit." (at 379.73 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 46a96078-6101-5c6c-81b7-6f0e746321e3))
(text "U15 validates USB near 15V and AUX across 7-22V, gives USB priority, and prevents inactive-source backfeed." (at 379.73 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 8daa2032-4e79-56f0-8eab-0d00364d9d80))
(text "SMCJ24CA protects the 67V eFuse input; active OVP protects the BQ25798 24V recommended input limit." (at 379.73 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 95b99bb1-67b0-5267-895b-8e5d141ed353))
(text "NOTE: no wires used - connectivity is via matching label names (valid KiCad practice)." (at 20.32 219.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid c3a338c2-21f1-5aab-a1e2-c5f91963a7ba))
(text "J2: pins 1/2 PACK+, pins 3/4 PACK-, pin 5 cell1 tap, pin 6 cell2 tap. Verify harness order before first connection." (at 20.32 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid e4dba054-e93b-5dd0-b7ee-bc70e7765b76))
(text "U719 BQ7791500 autonomously protects each cell at 4.20V OV / 2.90V UV and drives back-to-back low-side FETs." (at 20.32 232.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid fda6cacc-d6ef-5e23-b0ca-b1c278684c8d))
(text "RS11=8mOhm gives 7.5A nominal OCD and 15A nominal SCD; U11/RS10 and F1 remain independent tighter/secondary protection." (at 20.32 237.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 4d4c1cb2-7418-5cd7-9efa-5e7e5bc39cd1))
(text "No motherboard battery thermistors are fitted. U719 TS uses TI's 10k-to-VSS unused-function connection; VTB is NC." (at 20.32 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 8cc76a15-b02b-57a8-aba8-91fe468f5628))
(text "BQ25798 /CE is fail-off: REGN pulls it high; active-high CHG_ENABLE turns Q700 on only after EC source validation." (at 20.32 250.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 3c5a3def-b8a6-52ff-bcb6-d2dbe85a8047))
(text "U2 ILIM_HIZ divider is a 3.0A hardware ceiling; EC programs a lower IINDPM from the selected TPS25751A Active PDO Contract (0x31)." (at 20.32 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 22b4efd7-4a84-5feb-bee7-3947e311b260))
(text "J190 is the one 7-22V nominal AUX/solar input; TPS26630 protects it before BQ25798." (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 2d5c429c-0695-58f0-ab1f-ccd5c2ca8cf6))
(text "Solar MPPT is implemented by BQ25798 firmware on this same input; there is no second charger path." (at 20.32 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid b01bf51b-9e59-5bf9-a245-822efbdcb5f3))
(text "AUX_DC_ADC measures the post-reverse-FET input so firmware can detect droop and reduce BQ25798 input current." (at 20.32 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid ab754776-88f1-56b7-a6c2-d62be80d4a3d))
(text "U2 VAC1/VAC2 tie to VBUS_COMBINED in no-external-mux mode; ACDRV1/2 go to GND." (at 20.32 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 955dbae9-6914-5da7-bb08-b75d4cc45aec))
(text "Q25 follows BQ25798EVM-842: SDRV disconnects pack discharge for electronic ship/hard-off while adapter charging can wake the pack." (at 20.32 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 0609ed47-8074-5919-9521-6d52746e1ae2))
(text "U11 accepts about 8.45-13.57V nominal; 11mOhm RS10 gives 4.55A nominal and <=5.51A worst-case trips." (at 20.32 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid b860fc50-5d38-5794-89af-a537187bf6de))
(text "BQ25798 TS is fixed at 58.9% REGN by 5.24k/7.50k; firmware sets TS_IGNORE=1. BQ34Z100 TS has 10k to VSS; set TEMPS=0." (at 20.32 317.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid d1882bb6-cef3-5217-9d98-3e613d9d68f2))
(text "MANDATORY STARTUP: hold MU_12V_ENABLE low; read TPS25751A PD Status 0x35 plus Active PDO/RDO 0x31/0x32; program VSYSMIN and IINDPM <= min(PDO-0.25A, 2.75A); require VSYS >=10.0V." (at 20.32 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 5743f329-84f8-5628-a351-6059deb48126))
(text "Then assert MU_12V_ENABLE and require MU_12V_PG within 20ms. Any PG timeout, source-invalid, charger fault, watchdog fault, or VSYS<10V disables the Mu rail." (at 20.32 332.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 12379f84-1670-51ed-89f2-109297b4d5f3))
(text "BQ25798 firmware must set STOP_WD_CHG=1 and TS_IGNORE=1, service faults, validate PDO current, and assert CHG_ENABLE only after safe limits are programmed." (at 20.32 340.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid a16db8b0-4a3a-5bd6-badb-c7620daa8d17))
(text "U718 is the aggregate AON safety boundary: 1.51A typical limit, true reverse blocking, 6.20V nominal UVLO, and 22.40V nominal OVLO." (at 20.32 347.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 0bfbdafc-a5cb-510e-aa42-2dba693280f7))
(text "AON UVLO corners are 6.06-6.36V: default 5V USB-C is negotiation-only; TPS25751A dead-battery boot must obtain a valid higher-voltage PDO before EC_AON_IN starts." (at 20.32 355.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid be90baec-fe06-5a20-8d7c-c6369cc0029d))
(text "A 5V-only USB-C source leaves the laptop off. AON_FAULT_N inhibits charging and Mu start; the service connector remains the assembly hard disconnect." (at 20.32 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid e4d5617c-fcfa-523a-b109-d929cb6d86a9))
(text "C746 provides low-ESR hold-up through LTC4418 break-before-make source switching." (at 20.32 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 219c9676-0a29-59fe-9be0-1d03aa4d2aea))
